stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UPLOADING : initiateUpload tạo ReviewVersion + UploadSession

    UPLOADING --> UPLOADED : completeUpload claim atomic (R2 finalize xong)
    UPLOADED --> UPLOADING : revertFinalizeClaim khi R2 finalize lỗi
    UPLOADED --> READY : driveCompletion với IMAGE (kèm reviewState AWAITING_REVIEW)
    UPLOADED --> PROCESSING : driveCompletion với VIDEO + emit review/upload.completed
    PROCESSING --> READY : applyMuxReady từ webhook video.asset.ready
    PROCESSING --> FAILED : applyMuxErrored (video.asset.errored) hoặc reject magic-bytes
    UPLOADED --> FAILED : applyMuxErrored hoặc reconcileStuckUploadedVersion (janitor)
    UPLOADING --> FAILED : abortUpload (user hủy, sau đó XÓA row) hoặc expireInflightUpload (janitor 24h)

    READY --> [*] : terminal (chỉ rời qua trash/purge P6)
    FAILED --> [*] : terminal (retry = tạo version mới)

    note right of UPLOADING
        Browser đang PUT part lên R2
        qua presigned URL (không qua server)
    end note
    note right of PROCESSING
        Mux đang encode
        muxAssetId được lưu bởi reviewProcessUpload
    end note
    note right of READY
        muxPlaybackId set, thành currentVersion của asset
        clear statusId approved cũ (FR-A04)
    end note

